  "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/assets/images/content/cf19d0e3fc69cb6a51.gif\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"מילים בכתב קפצ'ה\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"328\" data-original-width=\"331\" height=\"317\" src=\"/assets/images/content/cf19d0e3fc69cb6a51.gif\" width=\"320\" /></a></p><div><div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">מה בקפצ'ה</span></h2><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">ארבעה פריטי לבוש המוזכרים בפרשה, חבויים בקפצ'ה (</span><span face=\"sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: #f8f9fa; font-weight: normal;\">CAPTCHA</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">) שבתמונת הכותרת. גלו אותם.</span></span></p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">מכנה משותף</span></h2></div><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לפניכם צמדי מילים שאין ביניהם קשר.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אבל, יש להן מכנה משותף - באמצעות מילה שלישית, המתחברת לכל אחת מהן.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">👈דוגמה:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲 חולים<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲 צדקה</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">המילה המשותפת - בעלת 4 אותיות - הנה 'קופת'.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">👈בונוס:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">המילה 'השלישית' (המחברת) בכל צמד - מוזכרת בפרשה.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><u><b>צמד 1:<br /></b></u></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲🔲 ללדת<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲🔲 לטעת</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><u style=\"font-family: arial;\"><b>צמד 2:<br /></b></u><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲🔲🔲 ספורט<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲 המלך החדשים</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><u style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><b>צמד 3:<br /></b></span></u><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲 מי יודע<br /></span><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲 העם</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><u style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><b>צמד 4:<br /></b></span></u><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בְּנֵי 🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲<br /></span><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">יִבְנֶה&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span></span></p><div><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><u style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span><b>צמד 5:<br /></b></span></u><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;טוב<br /></span><span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🔲&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בסדר</span></span></p><div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">פתגמים פגומים</span></h2><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">גלו את הפתגמים והביטויים המופיעים בפרשה.<br /></span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">לדוגמה: הרוע נאצ = רועה צאן.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span>1👈&nbsp;</span></span><span dir=\"RTL\" face=\"Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"HE\" style=\"line-height: 115%;\">נען</span><span dir=\"LTR\"></span><span face=\"Calibri, &quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"HE\" style=\"line-height: 115%;\"><span dir=\"LTR\"></span> </span><span dir=\"RTL\" face=\"Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;\" lang=\"HE\" style=\"line-height: 115%;\">רתטקה</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">2👈&nbsp;</span></span><span face=\"Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;\">חיר חניח</span></span></p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span><span style=\"background-color: white;\">3👈&nbsp;</span></span><span face=\"Arial, &quot;sans-serif&quot;\">חתא נשבה</span></span></p><p><br /></p></div></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">מדרגאות</span></span></h2></div><div><h3><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\"><span>🔲</span><span>🔲 הלוואי<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲 מוט ברזל<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲 אתמול<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲 ארץ מְכוֹרָה (מהפרשה)&nbsp;<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲 עניות<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲 לוח המוצב בכניסה<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: normal;\">🔲 אמונה</span></span></p></h3><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">פתרונות</span></h2><div><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">מה בקפצ'ה</span></span></h3><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">מכנסים, כתנת, אבנט, מצנפת</span></span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">מכנה משותף</span></span></h3><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">עת</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">בגדי</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">אחד</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">ביתו</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">יהיה</span></span></li></ol></span></div><div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">פתגמים פגומים</span></span></h3><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><ol><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">ענן הקטרת</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">ריח ניחח</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">אחת בשנה</span></span></li></ol></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מדרגאות</span></span></h3><h3><div></div></h3><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לו, לום, תמול, מולדת, דלות, דלת, דת</span></div>"
